# libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Dossiers d'inventaire.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) appels [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), qui crée un dossier par tour à `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (ou juste `<inventory-dir>` quand il y a un seul tour). Pour chaque dossier, `build_dev_inventory` résout la charge utile de la variante par application et la fait entrer dans l'inventaire `host_vars` comme `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` les dépassements. L'inventaire est donc résolu par variante sur disque; aucun sélecteur d'exécution n'est nécessaire."

# libretranslate
